<title>FRANCE: ATHLETICS-KIPKETER BREAK 800 METRES WORLD RECORD.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-KIPKETER BREAK 800 METRES WORLD RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wilson Kipketer of Denmark broke</p>
<p>his own 800 metres indoor world record on Sunday when he clocked</p>
<p>one minute 42.67 seconds at the world indoor championships.</p>
<p>Kipketer set his previous mark of 1:43.96 on Friday.</p>
